      "statement": "Theorem 3.1",
      "title": "Principalization",
      "scope": "Triples (X, I, E) with X smooth of finite type over a field of characteristic zero, I an ideal sheaf nonzero on every component and E an snc divisor; compatible with smooth morphisms. The isomorphism locus is the complement of the cosupport of I together with the singular locus of E.",
      "status": "proof included"
    },
